## 解答

设 $a_n = \sum_{j=1}^n \frac{1}{j}$，$b_n = \sum_{k=1}^n a_k$，且 $c_n = \sum_{k=1}^n \frac{b_k}{k+1}$。

### $b_n$ 的计算

交换求和顺序：

$$b_n = \sum_{k=1}^n \sum_{j=1}^k \frac{1}{j} = \sum_{j=1}^n \frac{1}{j}\sum_{k=j}^n 1 = \sum_{j=1}^n \frac{n-j+1}{j} = \sum_{j=1}^n \frac{n+1}{j} - \sum_{j=1}^n 1$$

$$\boxed{b_n = (n+1)a_n - n.}$$

对于 $n=1988$，由于 $a_{1988} = a_{1989} - \tfrac{1}{1989}$：

$$b_{1988} = 1989\,a_{1988} - 1988 = 1989\!\left(a_{1989}-\tfrac{1}{1989}\right) - 1988 = 1989\,a_{1989} - 1 - 1988$$

$$\boxed{b_{1988} = 1989\,a_{1989} - 1989 = 1989\,(a_{1989}-1).}$$

### $c_n$ 的计算

利用 $b_k = (k+1)a_k - k$：

$$\frac{b_k}{k+1} = a_k - \frac{k}{k+1}.$$

因此

$$c_n = \sum_{k=1}^n a_k - \sum_{k=1}^n \frac{k}{k+1} = b_n - \sum_{k=1}^n\!\left(1-\frac{1}{k+1}\right).$$

由于 $\sum_{k=1}^n \frac{1}{k+1} = a_{n+1}-1$，我们有 $\sum_{k=1}^n \frac{k}{k+1} = n - (a_{n+1}-1) = n+1-a_{n+1}$。所以

$$c_n = b_n - (n+1-a_{n+1}) = (n+1)a_n - n - n - 1 + a_{n+1} = (n+1)a_n + a_{n+1} - 2n - 1.$$

代入 $a_n = a_{n+1} - \tfrac{1}{n+1}$，即 $(n+1)a_n = (n+1)a_{n+1}-1$：

$$c_n = (n+1)a_{n+1} - 1 + a_{n+1} - 2n - 1 = (n+2)a_{n+1} - 2(n+1).$$

对于 $n=1988$ ($n+1 = 1989$, $n+2 = 1990$)：

$$\boxed{c_{1988} = 1990\,a_{1989} - 3978.}$$

### 验证

- $n=1$: $b_1 = 1 = 2\cdot a_1 - 1 = 2\cdot1-1 = 1$ ✓; $c_1 = \tfrac12 = 3\,a_2 - 4 = 3\cdot\tfrac32 - 4 = \tfrac12$ ✓.
- $n=2$: $b_2 = 1+\tfrac32 = \tfrac52 = 3\,a_2 - 2 = 3\cdot\tfrac32-2 = \tfrac52$ ✓; $c_2 = \tfrac12+\tfrac56 = \tfrac43 = 4\,a_3 - 6 = 4\cdot\tfrac{11}{6}-6 = \tfrac43$ ✓.

### 答案

$$b_{1988} = 1989\,(a_{1989}-1), \qquad c_{1988} = 1990\,a_{1989} - 3978.$$

